# /usage on a fresh home: the menu row, the dashboard before anything was
# counted, then after one turn the fake gateway did not bill (no billing
# metadata in markdown-turn.json), the keys on the 30-day window, and /cost.
models models.json
gateway markdown-turn.json
wait 2.5
type /usage
wait 0.5
snap typed
key Enter
wait 2
snap empty
key Escape
wait 0.5
type explain the plan please
key Enter
wait 5
snap answered
type /usage
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap open
key Right
wait 1.5
snap right1
key Left
wait 1
snap left
key Down
wait 0.5
snap down
key Tab
wait 1
snap tab
key BTab
wait 1
snap btab
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
type /cost
wait 0.5
snap cost-typed
key Enter
wait 2
snap cost-open
key Escape
wait 0.3
type /usage 7d
key Enter
wait 1
snap arg
